    <summary>Lightweight website SEO audit tool and CLI by SEOWebChecker.</summary>
    <description>
SEOWebChecker SEO Audit SDK &amp; CLI is an open-source tool for full technical SEO audits, on-page analysis, and Core Web Vitals checks.

Official Website: https://seowebchecker.com/
Documentation: https://seo-ai-tools.readthedocs.io/en/latest/

Features:
- On-page technical SEO validation (title, description, canonicals, robots, meta tags)
- Heading structure and content hierarchy analysis
- Core Web Vitals and page performance checks
- Cross-platform CLI execution
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/jaiganesh6999/seowebchecker-seoaudit-sdk/releases/tag/1.0.0</releaseNotes>
